# App environment (optional)

Copy to `.env.local` for live POP wallet sync:

```bash
VITE_POP_VALIDATOR_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787
```

When set, the wallet tab polls `GET /v1/pending-holds?localUserRef=demo-user-001` and
Loop 1 reward collection POSTs proof packets to the validator instead of mock settlement.

Requires validator running with Supabase env configured.
